          "exemptions": "Same subdivision (e) exemptions as the base just cause rule. Additionally, if a government agency or court determines the tenant is at fault for the condition triggering an order to vacate under (b)(2)(C), the tenant is not entitled to the relocation assistance. Applies only where the termination is for no-fault just cause, a fact not modeled in coverage.",
          "overrides": [],
          "interaction": "The relocation assistance or rent waiver is credited against any other relocation assistance required by any other law.",
          "effective_date": null,
          "source_doc_id": "D023",
          "conflict_flag": false,
          "conflict_note": null
        },
        {
